<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P rates Dah Sing-originated mortgage notes AAA.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Dah Sing-originated mortgage notes AAA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned its AAA rating to Hong Kong SAR Residential Mortgages Ltd's $300 million mortgage-backed floating rate notes.</p>
<p>The notes are secured by a pool of floating rate residential mortgages originated in Hong Kong by Dah Sing Bank Ltd, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
